aptkeyman (0.0.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * wellknown: Microsoft 2025 signer (EE4D7792…); add graphics-drivers
    PPA; keep microsoft-legacy.
  * write_keyfile: stage under system tmp before installing to dest (no
    sibling *.tmp under /usr/share/keyrings).
  * Install keys to /etc/apt/keyrings by default; check
    /usr/share/keyrings for freshness; rewrite Signed-By when migrating
    outdated system keys.
  * download/update: fetch keys concurrently (-j/--jobs).
  * Honor http_proxy/https_proxy/no_proxy; add --proxy/--http-proxy/
    --https-proxy/--no-proxy. Per-key proxy_mode column (auto|always|
    never|URL); seed always for hosts typically blocked from China.
  * update: keep local keydata when keyurl is empty (distro keyrings).
  * update: always install refreshed keys under keyrings dir and rewrite
    Signed-By; purge only deletes under keyrings dir (never /usr/share).
  * seed: do not overwrite managed installed_path with vendor keyring paths.
  * download/update: docker-pull style concurrent progress on stderr (-q
    quiet); split fetch/progress/verify helpers out of aptkeyman_keys.

 -- Lenik (谢继雷) <lenik@bodz.net>  Mon, 23 Nov 2026 20:00:00 +0900

